title A grep that never settled it
rota lap 4238, row 3 -- Water, the row that tastes, whose cardinal seat became what-brix-infuse-is three laps ago. The row's own subject is convergence, and this lap is about convergence: the seat earned itself on its second reading.
think The plan was to take the four remaining unproven writers one at a time, starting with dated_path_exclusions and giving each a sample that triggers it.
think Reading the first one ended the plan. It is a shared LIBRARY that emits exclusion lists and takes a root directory; it writes nothing to the tree. So it never needed a sample -- it needed to not be in the population.
obs THREE OF THE FOUR ARE NOT WRITERS AT ALL. dated_path_exclusions and dated_classify_seam are shared libraries -- one a list, one a regex seam -- and upstream_shape_scan reads a remote. Exactly ONE of the four transforms a document, and it converges. The tree's document writers are, as far as any measurement here reaches, all proven.
obs SO THE DENOMINATOR HAS NOW BEEN WRONG FOUR TIMES AND A FIFTH GREP WAS THE WRONG ANSWER. 392 when every pen write counted, 1200 when the census read its own bound as a measurement, 30 when controls counted, 7 after excluding controls -- and of that seven, three were still not writers. Each refinement looked like a measurement and each was a description of a naming convention.
obs THE HONEST END IS A RENAME RATHER THAN A REFINEMENT. The reading is `candidates` now, not `writers`, because a static pattern finds things that MIGHT need proving and cannot tell a document writer from a library or a scan. The prover classifies by RUNNING, and its inert verdict exposed each of these in turn. The census's closing line no longer says its denominator is defended; it says the denominator is an upper bound.
obs A NUMBER THAT KEEPS NEEDING REFINEMENT IS USUALLY MEASURING THE WRONG THING. Four refinements is the signal, and the fix was not a better pattern but a different instrument -- one that runs the tool rather than reading it. Water's whole instruction is to taste it, and this is what tasting produced.
loom convergence_final candidates=7 proven=3 unproven=4 real_document_writers=1 that_one=converges
loom convergence_denominators n=4 sequence=392,1200,30,7 residual_non_writers_in_7=3
file tools/c/convergence_census.sh the reading renamed candidates, with the four wrong denominators recorded
file tools/c/convergence_census_witness.rish assertions and closing line aligned to the honest naming
scope one Water lap -- a queue of four dissolved by reading the first, and a number renamed rather than refined a fifth time
status GREEN -- convergence_census green after the rename, tracked links ok
recommend keep-going -- the convergence thread is closed as far as measurement reaches; the next open door is the topology_churn find from 20260907, whose 150x rise on level inputs still stands unexplained and now has six recorded runs rather than two.
